While there exist various ways to further analyse the constructed gene rankings (Fig. 1.2e; see also Section Use cases), our current version of pathXcite already provides an interactive over-representation analysis (ORA) module. To perform these analyses, users can select from over \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
